### Reviewed component details
OpenInChat is a versatile client-side React component that opens a pre-filled prompt in leading conversational AI platforms, including ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Grok, and v0. It supports two primary presentation layouts: a standard dropdown menu triggered by an accessible button, and a compact horizontal bar containing standalone provider icon links. The component handles dynamic URL encoding and query parameter construction for each provider (using 'q' or provider-specific parameters). It provides customizable triggers, tooltips, alignments, and direct provider helper components (OpenInChatGPT, OpenInClaude, OpenInPerplexity, OpenInGrok, OpenInV0). Direct dependencies include lucide-react and simple-icons for provider brand SVGs. The component integrates seamlessly with standard Tailwind CSS and shadcn/ui primitives (Button, DropdownMenu, Tooltip). For installation, place open-in-chat.tsx under your components directory alongside the ai-icons.tsx helper, ensure Tailwind and Radix UI primitives are configured, and pass the target prompt string to the OpenInChat component.

